Parity arithmetic reproduced exactly from the web source (cross-platform value parity, NOT a
"corrected" version):
  regenPct        = (regenRatio ?? 0) * 100
  gauge.percent   = Math.round(regenPct)            (label "{n}%")
  gauge.tone      = regenColor(RAW regenPct): >30 good(#10b981) / >15 warning(#f59e0b) / else danger(#ef4444)
                    (= Color.TS.statusSuccess / statusWarning / statusDanger — exact hex in dark theme)
  Total Recovered = formatEnergy(totalRegenWh, {precision:1}) = convertEnergyFromSI(wh,'kWh')=wh/1000 + " kWh"
  Monthly Avg     = formatPower(monthlyAvgRegen, {precision:1}) = convertPowerFromSI(w,'kW')=w/1000 + " kW"
  Free Charges    = fmtInt(freeCharges) = grouped, 0 fraction digits
  formatNumber    = en_US grouped, fixed fraction digits, half-away-from-zero; non-finite SI → '—'.

